# Personal CV evidence binder — fully local-only. Public site (.github.io),
# so nothing here is tracked: publisher-version paper PDFs must not be
# publicly hosted (copyright), and patents / software registrations / degree
# certificates contain personal IDs / KIMM internal numbers. The site serves
# curated paper PDFs from assets/pdf/papers/ instead.
cv_documents/

# Company-tailored industry CV variants. Each file targets one employer, and
# this repo is the public site -- a recruiter at one company must not be able
# to read the summary written for another. The generator already refuses to
# write a variant PDF into assets/pdf/; this keeps the source YAML out too.
tools/cv_variants/
